stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Healthy
  Healthy --> WorkerCrash: /healthz fails 3x
  WorkerCrash --> Respawning: supervisor kills + spawn
  Respawning --> Healthy: /healthz 200
  Respawning --> Degraded: 3 respawns within 60s
  Degraded --> Healthy: manual restart or /healthz 200
  Healthy --> RendererCrash: window unresponsive
  RendererCrash --> Healthy: reload WebView
  Healthy --> ShellCrash: panic
  ShellCrash --> [*]: OS exit, next launch reports E_SHELL_PREVIOUS_UNCLEAN_EXIT
